ry  tears of happiness nantkishore thanks  ram for helping ishan and apologizes for  his behavior lastly ishan bids farewell  to ram and goes back to his hometown for  a vacation  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching

